{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2023-01-23 07:10:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL MARKS ANOTHER YEAR OF STRONG ACCELERATION IN SIGNINGS', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD. , JAN. 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT THE AMERICAS LODGING INVESTMENT SUMMIT (ALIS) IN LOS ANGELES, MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MAR) ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S DEAL SIGNINGS ACCELERATED AGAIN IN 2022."}